{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104330","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910433001:1":{"text":"어젯밤에 방에서 나왔나?","source_cn":"你们，昨晚离开房间了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC965C700554B8671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910433002:1":{"text":"卡律先生，请先回答我们的一个问题！昨天网上，我们睡觉的时候……你出门了吗？","source_cn":"卡律先生，请先回答我们的一个问题！昨天网上，我们睡觉的...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5D45901BEAFCF903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910433003:1":{"text":"发生了什么？","source_cn":"发生了什么？","status":"ambiguous_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910433004:1":{"text":"정말 몰라서 물어? 네 동생이 발작을 했다고!","source_cn":"你不知道吗？你弟弟发病了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E73C21CE9451490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910433005:1":{"text":"어이, 촉수! 밤이 되면 동생이 변한다는 걸 알고 있었지?!","source_cn":"喂！触手男，你早就知道他晚上会变成那样，是不是？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA307D7C901DA35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910433006:1":{"text":"알고 있으면서 혼자 내버려 둔 거잖아. 애가 괴로워서 미쳐 가는데 혼자 편하게 밖으로 나가 돌아다녔어?","source_cn":"你早就知道，才把他一个人扔在这里。他难受得发疯，你倒是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE7BC942DD9EF5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910433007:1":{"text":"좋은 형인 줄 알았는데... 쯧! 내가 사람을 잘못 봤네!","source_cn":"咱还以为你是个好哥哥……呸！是咱看错你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9A0DDDF73C2AE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1910433007":{"text":"좋은 형인 줄 알았는데... 쯧! 내가 사람을 잘못 봤네!","source_cn":"咱还以为你是个好哥哥……呸！是咱看错你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9A0DDDF73C2AE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910433008:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910433009:1":{"text":"그 소리 때문이다.","source_cn":"是那个声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB68ADFB12C24345F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1910433009":{"text":"그 소리 때문이다.","source_cn":"是那个声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB68ADFB12C24345F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910433010:1":{"text":"심해족에게는 어떤 소리가 들려온다. 가네트에게도 들리고, 나 역시 마찬가지지.","source_cn":"深海裔会听到一种声音。歌尼特能听到，我也一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x854C2AFEE8D81333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910433011:1":{"text":"그 소리를 들으면 우리는 스스로를 통제할 수 없을 만큼 광기에 빠져 미쳐 버린다.","source_cn":"听到声音，我们就会发狂——无法控制地发狂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E81F1B86341E3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910433012:1":{"text":"声音……","source_cn":"声音……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x798C050872D5EC62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910433013:1":{"text":"처음에는 가끔 밤에만 들렸지. 하지만 점점 더 자주, 더 선명하게 들리기 시작했다.","source_cn":"一开始，那声音只偶尔在夜间出现，之后越来越频繁，越来越清晰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682DF5E637D45B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910433014:1":{"text":"그리고 마침내 그 소리가 끊임없이 들려오기 시작하면... 그걸로 끝이다. 살육과 포식밖에 모르는 괴물로 변해 가며, 더는 네 자신이 아니게 되는 거지.","source_cn":"到最后，你不间断地听到它时，你就完了。你将逐渐变成只知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F18733541F6A82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910433015:1":{"text":"나와 가네트는 밤마다 그 소리를 듣는다. 가네트는 그물로 막을 수 있지만, 난 그럴 수 없다.","source_cn":"我和歌尼特都会在晚上听到它。歌尼特能被渔网拦住，我不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD435DEA3AEE35444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910433016:1":{"text":"그래서 밤에 자리를 비운 거다.","source_cn":"所以昨晚我走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1A799645C67027","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910433017:1":{"text":"소리? 이상한 소리 같은 건 못 들었는데. 어이, 책임을 피하려고 헛소리하는 거 아니지?","source_cn":"声音？咱可没听到什么奇怪的声音。喂，触手男，你该不会是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633FCE8B5C518D64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910433018:1":{"text":"...칼릭스, 그 소리... 혹시...","source_cn":"……卡律先生，你说的声音……是不是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B60D557472E3834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910433019:1":{"text":"...북소리야? 누군가 산호 밑바닥을 끊임없이 두드리는 것처럼... 그리고 말을 거는 소리도 들리고...","source_cn":"……鼓声？像鼓声，像有人不停敲击珊瑚的底部……还有人在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6902F857A6617A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910433020:1":{"text":"뭐? 엘피라, 너...","source_cn":"什么？！艾菲拉，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D60ED6E9819B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910433021:1":{"text":"네.","source_cn":"是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9F7DF5D35566E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910433022:1":{"text":"천해족의 딸, 너도 들었군.","source_cn":"浅海裔的女儿，你也听到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x145DFB920434F1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910433023:1":{"text":"자, 잘은 모르겠어. 그때는 꿈을 꾸고 있었거든. 어쩌면 그냥 잘못 들은 걸지도 몰라. 악몽이었을 수도 있으니까, 푹 쉬면 다시는 안 들릴지도 모르고...","source_cn":"我……我不确定，我当时是在做梦，或许、或许我只是听错了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA256BF64DDC25E8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910433024:1":{"text":"아니요, 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"不。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC74AE3C4604443D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910433025:1":{"text":"그 소리는 한번 들리기 시작하면 절대 멈추지 않아.","source_cn":"那声音一旦出现，就不会停下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC23A09B3197F0CCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910433026:1":{"text":"네게도 들린다는 건 이게 심해족만의 문제가 아니라는 뜻이다.","source_cn":"你能听到，就代表着这不止是深海裔的危机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788BAC23CBE054CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910433027:1":{"text":"함께 해결할 방법을 찾아야 해. 최대한 빨리 나를 타라사로 데려가라.","source_cn":"尽快带我去塔拉萨，我们一起找到解决方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFF9D5B5C566E51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910433028:1":{"text":"그렇지 않으면 너와 네 가족들도 미쳐 버려서, 결국 서로를 죽이고 집어삼키며 사지를 찢어발기게 될 거다.","source_cn":"否则，你和你的家人也会发疯，会互相杀戮、吞噬、肢解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71F4B483FC3BD0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910433029:1":{"text":"우리처럼.","source_cn":"和我们一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA222C69B157FBD09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910433030:1":{"text":"...아, 아니야. 그럴 리가 없어!","source_cn":"——不，不会的！绝不可能发生那种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7084BCC3911C19C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910433031:1":{"text":"...미, 미안해... 나...","source_cn":"……对、对不起……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E80DAA53A30731A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910433032:1":{"text":"잠깐 진정할 시간을 줘. 생각 좀 해 볼게...","source_cn":"让我冷静一下，让我想想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36D5DF393088B119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"네?!","source_cn":"什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C643EB1FA1741A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네?!","female":"네?!","variant_male_record_index":"96051","variant_female_record_index":"96052","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"图澜，冷静一点","source_cn":"图澜，冷静一点","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x69C4F53D5E8597CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"96047","variant_female_record_index":"96048","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"칼릭스, 설명이 필요해","source_cn":"卡律，我们需要一个解释","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x124D0A5D1991F750","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"칼릭스, 설명이 필요해","female":"칼릭스, 설명이 필요